{"title":"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Just_2_min!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Just 2 min!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Punxsutawney_Phil\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Simon&#39;s_Favorite_Factoring_Trick)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Simon's Favorite Factoring Trick)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Hawk_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Hawk Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Two distinct numbers are selected from the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/9/9d90f234623a632cfe3dc12728d076ca3a31d00d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,2,3,4,\\dots,36,37\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"18\" /> so that the sum of the remaining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7f6c79f2148f0cec592c9517b40ee1b82ef22e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> numbers is the product of these two numbers. What is the difference of these two numbers?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/9/c09782573923feaeeb698171ed4d19fa465280b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }5 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }7 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }8\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }9 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) }10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"362\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> integers is given by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/f/64f8070867b03b0dc224db7e741135e07f4502c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/e/03e93164e2d73694e6b320c730bd8e4d53e66d94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{37(37+1)}{2}=703$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"139\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/4/fb45faa2bca593d76a69db08784709a4b9fcc9eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$703-x-y=xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Rearranging, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/2/352b94fc258131f828fccd98a6c5275f22f152a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy+x+y=703$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" />. We can factor this equation by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=SFFT\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SFFT\">SFFT</a> to get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/5/fe5b321505a8b8faf5f7875810b708b9df879582.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)(y+1)=704$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"162\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Looking at the possible divisors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0fc36007a73940281ed902ed65e36e252fe928a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$704 = 2^6\\cdot11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d111a5e00ee5ea6700bb629994dc629874c505b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4b8590f8aa9f9894b3891dd5dede0e354fa04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> are within the constraints of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffa7a666c770027e4fecc9d20cfad8e54ca704a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; x \\leq y \\leq 37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"17\" /> so we try those:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/8/9e83224c318950fb4179bad89b07a6da1d328dd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)(y+1) = 22\\cdot32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"186\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/5/215b9536ddd05d1752a39c35dcb6176ec17f6380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1=22, y+1 = 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"175\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/a/68af430d38f2a1b1105c1c2f37d8047e9c97d3bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 21, y = 31$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"111\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the difference <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/9/9b9c6fa842b80c3f1072af193f2d8e4de50dfa13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y-x=31-21=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"214\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~ SoySoy4444\n</p><p>~MathFun1000 (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/latex.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\LaTeX$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" /> help)\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Just_2_min.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Just_2_min!)\">Video Solution (Just 2 min!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Just 2 min!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/QBRhWc8BT7U\">https://youtu.be/QBRhWc8BT7U</a>\n</p><p><i>~Education, the Study of Everything</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Punxsutawney_Phil\">Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Punxsutawney Phil\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://YouTube.com/watch?v=yxt8-rUUosI&amp;t=292s\">https://YouTube.com/watch?v=yxt8-rUUosI&amp;t=292s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_.28Simon.27s_Favorite_Factoring_Trick.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Simon's_Favorite_Factoring_Trick)\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Simon's Favorite Factoring Trick)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Simon&#39;s Favorite Factoring Trick)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/v8MVGAZapKU\">https://youtu.be/v8MVGAZapKU</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Hawk_Math\">Video Solution by Hawk Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Hawk Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p4iCAZRUESs\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p4iCAZRUESs</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/kuZXQYHycdk?t=1227\">https://youtu.be/kuZXQYHycdk?t=1227</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B\">2021 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2021 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=20